 "library": {
  "title": "Modern porch",
  "description": "Modern porch: an entrance porch for the front door of a house \u2014 a flat cantilevered canopy on slim supports, clean lines. Overall about 4.0 x 2.5 x 3.0 m (width x depth x height). Stands on z = 0; place it against a facade with the door behind it. One of five porch styles (classical, craftsman, Victorian, rustic, modern) designed together.",
